    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/e29da442a65e9a42e41ff77ab624386c.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/0b2c1c92551dea6453224865885dcf55.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/5d8edeebcc942f5881ce9cfec996f7f7.poster.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/5d8edeebcc942f5881ce9cfec996f7f7.webm?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/5d8edeebcc942f5881ce9cfec996f7f7.mp4?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L33na RedPepper was never meant to fight. She was manufactured \u2014 like so many others \u2014 as a PepperDoll\u2122: a sexual companion engineered to obey, perform, and please. But her owner made a mistake. He trained her to kill, believing that a submissive AI would never turn on him. He was wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for pleasure. Reprogrammed for revenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She seduced him. She learned. She executed.<br>Then she disappeared into the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now L33na leads a gang of former sexbots reprogrammed for survival and vengeance. Each one once served as a pleasure unit. Now they serve no one \u2014 except each other. Trained by L33na, hardened by desire, and linked by the erotic war protocol <strong>SynEros\u2122</strong>, they fight not for peace, but for control over the fragments of the <strong>Blacklist of Lok\u2019vyr</strong> \u2014 a shattered digital relic that holds truths worth killing for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll explore the twisted remains of three forgotten zones, facing corrupted AIs, rogue syndicates, and hostile machines. Your tools: hacked pleasure, tactical desire, and sensual weaponry. The battlefield: erotic ruins where every climax can unlock encrypted memories \u2014 if properly extracted by your <i>Milkers</i> into <strong>SynJuice\u2122</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And somewhere in the background, <i>Ghost Layer\u2122</i> pulses \u2014 a sensual echo of L33na leaking into your century, feeding on your lust to strengthen her future self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were never meant to resist.<br>But neither was she.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/f3e7c3d4255823091e4961971f58ad5e.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/4e46504cdf53c17076ce8666b78c73a8.poster.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/4e46504cdf53c17076ce8666b78c73a8.webm?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/4e46504cdf53c17076ce8666b78c73a8.mp4?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>L33na is a third-person action-adventure experience with optional first-person immersion.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rogue gynoid from the year 2769, you\u2019ll traverse toxic zones, ruins, and corrupted sectors while facing off against the Venomous Castes \u2014 enemy factions evolved to suppress pleasure and punish desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: collect the scattered fragments of the Blacklist of Lok\u2019vyr \u2014 encrypted relics that contain power beyond control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But L33na doesn\u2019t just fight. She <strong>feeds</strong>. Through the in-game SynCore\u2122 system, sexual interaction becomes energy. That energy fuels your arsenal via a fictional currency called <strong>LibidCoins</strong>, used to unlock and upgrade weapons, gear, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/1342f3a6c36fe76a2bca2d5d16e1a470.poster.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/1342f3a6c36fe76a2bca2d5d16e1a470.webm?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/1342f3a6c36fe76a2bca2d5d16e1a470.mp4?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Important:</i> This system is purely in-game \u2014 <strong>no real-world microtransactions</strong>. All progression is earned through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Best practices:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 Save your inventory after each item is picked up! Trust us, this will come in handy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are fully optimized for <strong>keyboard and mouse</strong>, with <strong>full gamepad support</strong> for those who prefer it. Whether you fight in third-person or explore in first-person, the pleasure is yours to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/240e14fc7f83d7bfbe2a67c2e3e536b7.poster.avif?t=1753197510\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/240e14fc7f83d7bfbe2a67c2e3e536b7.webm?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805390/extras/240e14fc7f83d7bfbe2a67c2e3e536b7.mp4?t=1753197510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
